    "“%@” already exists. Replace it with the file from this Mac? The file on the server is replaced only once the new one has been uploaded completely." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”已存在。要用此 Mac 上的文件替换它吗？只有在新文件完整上传后才会替换服务器上的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” cannot be replaced safely: %@. Nothing was changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”无法安全替换：%@。未更改任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” cannot be replaced safely: %@. Overwrite it in place? If the transfer is interrupted, the previous contents of the file are lost." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”无法安全替换：%@。要就地覆盖吗？若传输中断，文件原有内容将丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” cannot be uploaded: it is a whole volume or not a file name. Open it and choose what is inside instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法上传“%@”：它是整个宗卷，或者不是文件名。请打开它，选择里面的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” changed during the upload. The remote file was left unchanged; upload again to review the conflict." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上传期间“%@”发生了变化，远程文件未被替换。请重新上传并确认冲突。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” contains a file name that is not valid UTF-8. It cannot be sent back to the server unchanged, so this folder was left as it is. Rename that file on the server first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”里有一个文件名不是有效的 UTF-8，无法原样发回服务器，因此没有改动这个文件夹。请先在服务器上给它改名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is a link, and the file it points to cannot be read, so it cannot be edited (%@)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”是链接，其指向的文件无法读取，因此无法编辑（%@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is a link. This changes the permissions of what it points to." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”是一个链接。这里更改的是它所指向项目的权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is a pipe, a device or a socket, not a file. It cannot be downloaded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”是管道、设备或套接字，不是文件，无法下载。"
