    "A backup does not include the key file on this Mac (%@): without a master password, its saved passwords and SSH keys cannot be decrypted on another Mac. To move data between Macs, use the encrypted export in Sync." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "备份不包含这台 Mac 上的密钥文件（%@）：未设置主密码时，备份中已保存的密码和 SSH 密钥无法在另一台 Mac 上解密。要在 Mac 之间迁移数据，请使用“同步”中的加密导出。"
          }
        }
